## Dependency Management

```toml
# pyproject.toml
[project]
requires-python = ">=3.12"   # <-- single source of truth

[tool.ruff]
line-length = 100
target-version = "py312"
[tool.ruff.lint]
select = ["E", "F", "I", "UP", "B", "SIM", "RUF", "ASYNC", "PT"]

[tool.pyrefly]
python-version = "3.12"

[tool.pytest.ini_options]
asyncio_mode = "auto"
markers = [
    "unit: fast, no I/O",
    "integration: requires DB or network",
    "slow: > 5s",
]
```

- Justify every new dependency with a comment in `pyproject.toml`.
- Never `uv add` / `pip install` without updating the lockfile (`uv.lock`).
- Audit: `uv pip audit` (or equivalent) when adding or bumping dependencies.
